          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaandi mu Isiraeli: Be owa Paroshi: Ramia, Isia, Malkiya, Miyamini, Eliesa, Malichiya, ne Benaya. ",
